{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the thrill of destruction in the\u00a0<strong>Castle Crumble Demo</strong>, featuring the\u00a0<strong>Training Grounds biome</strong>\u00a0with\u00a0<strong>20 hand-crafted levels</strong>\u00a0designed to introduce you to the satisfying physics-based gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, your goal is simple -\u00a0<strong>bring castles down</strong>\u00a0using weapons and clever strategy. Watch each tower collapse in a fully simulated physics environment, where every beam and brick reacts to your actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Demo Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>20 levels</strong>\u00a0set in the\u00a0<i>Training Grounds</i>\u00a0biome</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A selection of\u00a0<strong>weapons</strong>\u00a0to experiment with different types of destruction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Puzzle-like challenges</strong>\u00a0where every shot counts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Real-time\u00a0<strong>physics-based destruction</strong>\u00a0- watch rubble fly and towers fall in unexpected ways</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're carefully knocking out support beams or triggering chain reactions, each level is a new chance to master the art of controlled demolition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707990/extras/02_eng.png?t=1746469659\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707990/extras/cc_02_chain_effect.gif?t=1746469659\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707990/extras/03_eng.png?t=1746469659\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src